      <data key="k493">Trace stakeholder intention, discovery, design options, implementation, independently specified checks, human review, deployment and feedback. Define the change dossier and responsible decision-maker at each handoff. This is the author's engineering reference workflow, motivated by software lifecycle evidence and agent-governance proposals rather than experimentally validated as a whole.</data>
