      <data key="k453" />
      <data key="k493">When a new regional requirement arrives after code exists, retain the previous intent revision; record who authorized the change, which design alternatives and checks it invalidates, and whether to amend, roll back or defer the implementation. Code-critique and OSS-policy observations motivate traceability; the delta/impact workflow is a proposed method rather than a measured benefit of those studies.</data>
