      <data key="k453" />
      <data key="k493">Define native gates on approved intention, invariants, architecture decisions, verification evidence and acceptance authority. Keep a legacy user-story/test-case view as an optional adapter when integrating established CI, rather than treating it as canonical. Use the CCS profile as a worked engineering example, not a method empirically demonstrated by Farrag or Qiu.</data>
