      <data key="k493">Distinguish generated-code provenance from responsibility to explain, maintain and recover a component. Historic ownership–quality studies provide measured background; the claim that AI invalidates traditional authorship metrics is a reasoned proposal that deserves empirical testing. Do not use newcomer-participation statistics as proof of the same effect.</data>
