      <data key="k453" />
      <data key="k493">Specify a bounded loop of diagnose, attempt, retest and evidence collection, followed by an external checker and human owner. A local pass is only review-ready; repeated rejection without a cited policy or changed evidence triggers adjudication instead of unbounded reruns. The exact budget and escalation policy is an author-proposed mechanism to pilot.</data>
      <data key="k520" />
    </node>
