      <data key="k453" />
      <data key="k493">Define a gap between code shipped and knowledge retained by the team. Ground the term in diary observations from student software projects, and contrast those qualitative patterns with controlled comprehension experiments; do not claim a quantified professional-team effect solely from student self-reports.</data>
