      <data key="k453" />
      <data key="k493">Make ownership transfer operational: name current system stewards, define who can modify acceptance contracts, schedule knowledge refresh and attach verified design rationale to handover. This applies the turnover and succession evidence of Chapter 9 to a team policy decision, rather than repeating a literature review of code ownership.</data>
