      <data key="k484">O001</data>
      <data key="k493">Osmani revises his earlier advice to inspect every generated line: routine low-risk changes may receive automated first-pass review, while high-blast-radius changes retain deeper scrutiny. He argues that review also transmitted knowledge and that engineering teams must retain both understanding and authority to refuse a release.</data>
