      <data key="k484">O012</data>
      <data key="k493">Loop engineering means configuring a system that discovers work, dispatches agents, checks outputs, records progress and repeats rather than manually prompting each step. Osmani identifies five recurring primitives: automations/scheduling, isolated Git worktrees, reusable skills, plugins and connectors, and specialized subagents. A separate persistent memory or task board is the sixth requirement for continuity. He also warns about verification, comprehension debt and unpredictable token costs.</data>
      <data key="k505">https://addyo.substack.com/p/loop-engineering</data>
      <data key="k520">2026</data>
