      <data key="k493">Osmani explores a world in which individuals and domain specialists build small personalized applications too narrow to justify traditional development contracts. The claim is about enabling software that previously would not be built at all. It is a forward-looking long-tail demand scenario, not a measured labor substitution, return-on-investment or full lifecycle cost study.</data>
      <data key="k505">https://addyo.substack.com/p/personal-software-the-unbundling</data>
      <data key="k520">2025</data>
    </node>
