      <data key="k260">Updated 19 October 2024. Disputed motivations and legal characterizations are attributed, not adjudicated. This non-Pulse-titled blog article is an excerpt of a Pulse issue originally published 2024-10-17. It passes the literal title-prefix rule; it is excluded by the optional stricter Pulse-origin filter. The parent issue is provenance only, not another P article. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k267">Useful as an ecosystem-governance and dependency-trust case. The headline is an argumentative question, not a legal finding of theft.</data>
