      <data key="k260">This non-Pulse-titled blog article is an excerpt of a Pulse issue originally published 2025-01-09. It passes the literal title-prefix rule; it is excluded by the optional stricter Pulse-origin filter. The parent issue is provenance only, not another P article. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k267">Offers a hypothesis about shifting developer knowledge-seeking. Question volume is a limited proxy, and the timing alone does not prove replacement or equivalent answer quality.</data>
      <data key="k268">The article concerns where developers obtain and preserve knowledge, not measured equivalence between generated and community answers.</data>
