      <data key="k237">Interview-preparation founders discuss selective hiring recovery, changing interview difficulty, domain specialization and differences between startup and large-company hiring.</data>
      <data key="k246">practitioner_article</data>
      <data key="k248">The Reality of Tech Interviews in 2025</data>
      <data key="k260">Contributors cofound Hello Interview; claims about a one-standard-deviation increase in hiring standards are not supported by a validated common scale in the preview. Interview-platform traffic and an asserted higher hiring bar have distinct, incompletely specified denominators; neither is a population employment statistic. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k267">The visible account highlights variation by experience and specialty. Platform activity is only a proxy for demand and cannot establish population-wide hiring rates.</data>
      <data key="k268">Interview preparation and assessment methods concern competence signals; commercial interests and selection limit generalization.</data>
      <data key="k270">NOT_ADDED_TO_MANUSCRIPT</data>
