      <data key="k428">MAPPING_REVISED</data>
      <data key="k429">Principal subject is hiring/recruiting; harmonize with other hiring records rather than a general-engineering catch-all. Retain engineering-practice relevance as a non-exclusive secondary facet. Interview-format and hiring-market observations do not evaluate delayed retention or engineering-fluency measures. Locate interview-selection methods in recruitment without implying validation of retained-skill measurement.</data>
