      <data key="k141">Gergely Orosz</data>
      <data key="k154">C09;C10</data>
      <data key="k160">The follow-up concerns knowledge-community activity; fewer questions do not prove disappearance of all usage or knowledge value.</data>
      <data key="k161">REVIEWED_PUBLIC_PASSAGE_CLASSIFICATION</data>
      <data key="k168">Updates an earlier analysis of falling Stack Overflow question counts, considering moderation history, alternative communities and LLM-based assistance.</data>
      <data key="k169">not_asserted</data>
