      <data key="k160">SDK contracts and reusable interfaces support maintainable systems without directly measuring AI-generated code quality.</data>
      <data key="k161">PROVISIONAL_PUBLIC_PREVIEW_CLASSIFICATION</data>
      <data key="k168">Quentin Pradet examines API-first design, SDK generation, documentation and ongoing maintenance for human and model consumers.</data>
