      <data key="k224">NO: classification-bearing public passages only; no claim of exhaustive full-text audit</data>
      <data key="k226">Code quality &amp; security</data>
      <data key="k235">Identifier frozen from the previous catalogue; not renumbered.</data>
      <data key="k237">Quentin Pradet examines API-first design, SDK generation, documentation and ongoing maintenance for human and model consumers.</data>
      <data key="k246">practitioner_article</data>
      <data key="k248">Building great SDKs</data>
      <data key="k260">A section explicitly discusses LLM-assisted SDK generation; it is secondary to the broader SDK design guidance. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k267">Clear contracts and robust libraries reduce integration friction; translating an SDK with an LLM does not remove language-specific correctness and maintenance work.</data>
