      <data key="k260">Non-Pulse-titled public excerpt of Pulse #154. This non-Pulse-titled blog article is an excerpt of a Pulse issue originally published 2025-11-20. It passes the literal title-prefix rule; it is excluded by the optional stricter Pulse-origin filter. The parent issue is provenance only, not another P article. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k267">Reliability depends on the complete dependency chain; removing a dependency can carry substantial cost and operational burden. This is a contextual trade-off, not proof that redundancy is unnecessary.</data>
