      <data key="k260">Only the public introduction, outline and opening discussion were inspected; the paid remainder was not accessed. Beck and Fowler are participants, not article byline coauthors. The Summit also informs P088, so these articles are not independent event evidence. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k267">The visible discussion argues for curiosity tempered by skepticism. The outline proposes attention to outcomes, work boundaries and engineering practice; these are participant recommendations, not measured productivity or retention effects.</data>
