      <data key="k292">["As Osmani observed, AI is trained on ``the lowest common denominator'' of open-source code. It doesn't optimize for security best practices. Common issues: hardcoded credentials, SQL injection vulnerabilities, XSS issues, authentication bypasses.", "\\item Expected to provide adequate resources"]</data>
