      <data key="k260">Attribution retained as written in the supplied source, not independently verified inventorship.</data>
      <data key="k292">["Understanding legacy code has always been time-consuming. Reading thousands of lines, tracing execution paths, understanding implicit assumptions. Junior engineers can spend weeks just getting oriented. Additionally, LLMs are trained on generic open-source code—they don't know your company's patterns, domain models, or architectural decisions without help.", "\\textbf{Method 2: Cross-Reference Multiple Sources}"]</data>
