      <data key="k107">Pattern B4</data>
      <data key="k121">{"actual":[],"authors":"","category":"practices","collection":null,"families":["FAMILY:F08"],"id":"OCC:SDD2:B4","kind":"practice_occurrence","label":"Convergence Review","limitation":"Attribution retained as written in the supplied source, not independently verified inventorship.","mapped":[],"printed":false,"streams":[],"summary":"Historical occurrence of Convergence Review in the retained V03 source. The original title, alias and file locator preserve its lineage. Read PAT:075 for the current English operational guidance and its qualifications.","topics":[],"url":"","volumes":["V03"],"year":""}</data>
      <data key="k162">OCC</data>
      <data key="k212">F08</data>
      <data key="k213">Critique, Review and Trust</data>
      <data key="k246">practice_occurrence</data>
      <data key="k248">Convergence Review</data>
      <data key="k250">en</data>
      <data key="k260">Attribution retained as written in the supplied source, not independently verified inventorship.</data>
      <data key="k292">["%  during autonomous execution. Sources: multi-model debate pattern in advanced LLM research.]", "\\paragraph{Practical example.} Phase~2 of \\code{feat-042} reaches a fork: store the OAuth grant--token mapping as an \\textit{event-sourced} stream (every issue, refresh and revocation as an immutable event) or as a \\textit{state-based} table with an append-only audit shadow. Marta runs \\code{sdd gate check 2 --convergence}. The primary model proposes event-sourcing, citing audit fidelity; the second model challenges, pointing out that the merchant dashboard reads the current grant state on every checkout (4~ms p95 budget), and event-replay at that volume needs a snapshot strategy the team has not budgeted for. Synthesis: state-based table plus an append-only audit table for compliance --- the cheaper option that satisfies both the SLO and Article~4 audit requirement. Two-model latency: 8~minutes; durable rationale captured in \\code{plan.md} \\S4."]</data>
      <data key="k373">PAT:075</data>
      <data key="k460">399</data>
      <data key="k463">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/chapters/chapter15_patterns.tex</data>
      <data key="k467">363</data>
