      <data key="k292">["\\textbf{Ralph connection:} This pattern suggests a dedicated orientation phase at the start of each Ralph iteration. Rather than just reading \\texttt{AGENTS.md}, the agent can actively search and query the codebase to build understanding. Huntley's ``search before implementing'' instruction is a minimal version of this; the full pattern extends it to systematic codebase comprehension."]</data>
