      <data key="k292">["\\textbf{Ralph connection:} Huntley's subagent management addresses this directly: ``only 1 subagent for build/tests'' while allowing many subagents for searching. The pattern generalizes this insight: explicitly control which tool patterns are encouraged versus discouraged through prompt instructions and quality metrics.", "\\section{Learning \\&amp; Adaptation Patterns}"]</data>
