      <data key="k260">Attribution retained as written in the supplied source, not independently verified inventorship.</data>
      <data key="k292">["\\textbf{Ralph connection:} This maps directly to the Developer Evolution Model from \\chapref{ch:evolution}. Stages 5--6 correspond to supervised mode. Stages 7--8 correspond to monitored mode. The theoretical Stage 9 (evolutionary software) corresponds to autonomous mode. The pattern formalizes what Huntley expresses as ``building software with Ralph requires a great deal of faith and a belief in eventual consistency.''"]</data>
