      <data key="k121">{"actual":[],"authors":"Birgitta Böckeler","category":null,"collection":"F","id":"F007","kind":"practitioner_essay","label":"How is GenAI different from other code generators?","limitation":"Conceptual comparison; it does not demonstrate the reliability or economic superiority of either approach.","mapped":["C:C01","C:C04","C:C05"],"printed":false,"streams":["T:Engineering structure"],"summary":"Contrasts generative assistance with model-driven development and domain-specific code generators. Examines how control and abstraction differ when generation draws on broad learned patterns rather than an explicitly designed transformation.","topics":["K:Specifications and governance","K:Architecture and modularity"],"url":"https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai/07-how-is-this-different.html","volumes":[],"year":"2023-09-19"}</data>
