      <data key="k168">An IoT modernization account connects physical test environments, device simulation, observability, recovery and continuous learning. The team used LLMs to explore unfamiliar areas, prototype experiments and develop engineering tools, including dashboards and migration trackers. The proposed benefit is cheaper experimentation and a shorter learning loop.</data>
