    <node id="NDSE2:C02">
      <data key="k121">{"actual":["C:C02"],"authors":"Enrico Papalini","category":null,"collection":"N","id":"NDSE2:C02","kind":"published_book_chapter","label":"Measuring Productivity from Code to Production","limitation":"Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.","mapped":["C:C02"],"printed":false,"streams":[],"summary":"Examines productivity measures from generated output to accepted releases. It distinguishes randomized evidence from observational comparisons and develops a pilot that records review, rework, quality and hidden human effort before an adoption decision.","topics":[],"url":"","volumes":["V06"],"year":"2026"}</data>
      <data key="k126">Enrico Papalini</data>
      <data key="k153">C:C02</data>
      <data key="k155">2</data>
      <data key="k192">EDITION:NDSE2:13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k207">Published author chapter; engineering synthesis</data>
      <data key="k246">published_book_chapter</data>
      <data key="k248">Measuring Productivity from Code to Production</data>
      <data key="k256">["scegliere un denominatore di produttività che comprenda review e rework", "distinguere l'accettazione effettivamente misurata dalla velocità dichiarata e dall'output generato", "progettare un confronto che protegga dalle distorsioni di selezione e dagli esiti di qualità non osservati"]</data>
      <data key="k257">["choose a productivity denominator that includes review and rework", "distinguish measured acceptance from reported speed and generated output", "design a comparison that protects against selection bias and missing quality outcomes"]</data>
      <data key="k260">Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.</data>
      <data key="k285">NDSE2_PUBLISHED_EDITION_20261018</data>
      <data key="k390">Author-supplied final EN/ITA 13.7.1 LaTeX sources; publication confirmed by the author on 2026-10-18.</data>
      <data key="k398">PUBLISHED_AUTHOR_CONFIRMED</data>
      <data key="k463">EN/chapters/chapter02.tex</data>
      <data key="k464">ITA/chapters/chapter02.tex</data>
      <data key="k477">2f513eeed43e6183a3b26ebcebaa19a35ab53dbf561260b015e69357b049a72f</data>
      <data key="k478">2336ccabfd1817c7c21c8f4e06fec37bee109fee2b80718824482abd5f393ddb</data>
      <data key="k481">13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k493">Examines productivity measures from generated output to accepted releases. It distinguishes randomized evidence from observational comparisons and develops a pilot that records review, rework, quality and hidden human effort before an adoption decision.</data>
      <data key="k494">Esamina la produttività dal codice generato ai rilasci accettati. Distingue le evidenze randomizzate dai confronti osservazionali e sviluppa un progetto pilota che misura revisione, rilavorazione, qualità e lavoro umano poco visibile prima di decidere sull'adozione.</data>
      <data key="k498">Measuring Productivity from Code to Production</data>
      <data key="k500">Misurare la produttività: dal codice alla produzione</data>
      <data key="k513">V06</data>
    </node>
