    <node id="NDSE2:C04">
      <data key="k121">{"actual":["C:C04"],"authors":"Enrico Papalini","category":null,"collection":"N","id":"NDSE2:C04","kind":"published_book_chapter","label":"Intentions, Contracts and Iterative Change","limitation":"Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.","mapped":["C:C04"],"printed":false,"streams":[],"summary":"Develops a versioned intention contract for an existing service. Behavioral examples and acceptance rules are established independently of implementation, while late policy changes trigger targeted impact analysis and invalidate only the decisions and evidence they affect.","topics":[],"url":"","volumes":["V06"],"year":"2026"}</data>
      <data key="k126">Enrico Papalini</data>
      <data key="k153">C:C04</data>
      <data key="k155">4</data>
      <data key="k192">EDITION:NDSE2:13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k207">Published author chapter; engineering synthesis</data>
      <data key="k246">published_book_chapter</data>
      <data key="k248">Intentions, Contracts and Iterative Change</data>
      <data key="k256">["separare l'approvazione dell'intenzione dal design dell'implementazione", "ricavare esempi comportamentali indipendenti da un contratto versionato", "integrare cambiamenti tardivi dell'intenzione invalidando soltanto le decisioni e le evidenze interessate"]</data>
      <data key="k257">["separate intention approval from implementation design", "derive independent behavioral examples from a versioned contract", "incorporate late intention changes by invalidating only the affected decisions and evidence"]</data>
      <data key="k260">Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.</data>
      <data key="k285">NDSE2_PUBLISHED_EDITION_20261018</data>
      <data key="k390">Author-supplied final EN/ITA 13.7.1 LaTeX sources; publication confirmed by the author on 2026-10-18.</data>
      <data key="k398">PUBLISHED_AUTHOR_CONFIRMED</data>
      <data key="k463">EN/chapters/chapter04.tex</data>
      <data key="k464">ITA/chapters/chapter04.tex</data>
      <data key="k477">f9ba7148a44598fb3bb1a59888f37f376faadff0f300dafb908a98168176f7a7</data>
      <data key="k478">878773f16a0704f3cb52d7547b3b7959cb5497eadfc30a93ad23816c8ac69ed5</data>
      <data key="k481">13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k493">Develops a versioned intention contract for an existing service. Behavioral examples and acceptance rules are established independently of implementation, while late policy changes trigger targeted impact analysis and invalidate only the decisions and evidence they affect.</data>
      <data key="k494">Sviluppa un contratto di intenzione versionato per un servizio esistente. Esempi comportamentali e regole di accettazione vengono stabiliti indipendentemente dall'implementazione; le modifiche tardive della policy richiedono un'analisi d'impatto e invalidano solo decisioni ed evidenze coinvolte.</data>
      <data key="k498">Intentions, Contracts and Iterative Change</data>
      <data key="k500">Intenzioni, contratti e cambiamento iterativo</data>
      <data key="k513">V06</data>
    </node>
