    <node id="NDSE2:C07">
      <data key="k121">{"actual":["C:C07"],"authors":"Enrico Papalini","category":null,"collection":"N","id":"NDSE2:C07","kind":"published_book_chapter","label":"Independent Verification and the Oracle Problem","limitation":"Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.","mapped":["C:C07"],"printed":false,"streams":[],"summary":"Builds independent verification around authorized behavior. Regression cases, properties, counterexamples and mutants expose circular testing; correlated checker errors and benchmark limits motivate an evidence dossier that supports review without granting the maker acceptance authority.","topics":[],"url":"","volumes":["V06"],"year":"2026"}</data>
      <data key="k126">Enrico Papalini</data>
      <data key="k153">C:C07</data>
      <data key="k155">7</data>
      <data key="k192">EDITION:NDSE2:13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k207">Published author chapter; engineering synthesis</data>
      <data key="k246">published_book_chapter</data>
      <data key="k248">Independent Verification and the Oracle Problem</data>
      <data key="k256">["ricavare un oracle indipendente dal comportamento autorizzato", "usare controesempi e mutant per smascherare i test circolari", "preparare un dossier di evidenze che consenta a un'altra persona di decidere se una modifica candidata sia pronta per la review"]</data>
      <data key="k257">["derive an independent oracle from authorized behavior", "use counterexamples and mutants to reveal circular testing", "assemble a dossier that allows another person to decide whether a candidate is ready for review"]</data>
      <data key="k260">Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.</data>
      <data key="k285">NDSE2_PUBLISHED_EDITION_20261018</data>
      <data key="k390">Author-supplied final EN/ITA 13.7.1 LaTeX sources; publication confirmed by the author on 2026-10-18.</data>
      <data key="k398">PUBLISHED_AUTHOR_CONFIRMED</data>
      <data key="k463">EN/chapters/chapter07.tex</data>
      <data key="k464">ITA/chapters/chapter07.tex</data>
      <data key="k477">0990c2265ce14a6e4f7274c64952b424d7b29678a995352ab6ec2258ca7dfe00</data>
      <data key="k478">7de646cec6272bbb7bdfb1f1ba7d6aa762680382fd4efac383bc341e8f394739</data>
      <data key="k481">13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k493">Builds independent verification around authorized behavior. Regression cases, properties, counterexamples and mutants expose circular testing; correlated checker errors and benchmark limits motivate an evidence dossier that supports review without granting the maker acceptance authority.</data>
      <data key="k494">Costruisce la verifica indipendente a partire dal comportamento autorizzato. Regressioni, proprietà, controesempi e mutanti rivelano i test circolari; errori correlati dei checker e limiti dei benchmark motivano un dossier di evidenze senza attribuire al maker l'autorità di accettazione.</data>
      <data key="k498">Independent Verification and the Oracle Problem</data>
      <data key="k500">Verifica indipendente e problema dell'oracle</data>
      <data key="k513">V06</data>
    </node>
