    <node id="NDSE2:C08">
      <data key="k121">{"actual":["C:C08"],"authors":"Enrico Papalini","category":null,"collection":"N","id":"NDSE2:C08","kind":"published_book_chapter","label":"Code Review and Trust Calibration","limitation":"Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.","mapped":["C:C08"],"printed":false,"streams":[],"summary":"Allocates review effort by consequence and uncertainty. It examines human and AI reviewers, false positives, shared blind spots and automation bias, then separates finding disposition, coverage of acceptance obligations and the accountable release verdict.","topics":[],"url":"","volumes":["V06"],"year":"2026"}</data>
      <data key="k126">Enrico Papalini</data>
      <data key="k153">C:C08</data>
      <data key="k155">8</data>
      <data key="k192">EDITION:NDSE2:13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k207">Published author chapter; engineering synthesis</data>
      <data key="k246">published_book_chapter</data>
      <data key="k248">Code Review and Trust Calibration</data>
      <data key="k256">["distribuire l'impegno della review in base alle conseguenze e all'incertezza", "riconoscere quando due reviewer condividono la stessa fonte di errore", "distinguere l'esito di un finding di review, la copertura degli obblighi di accettazione e l'autorità necessaria per la release"]</data>
      <data key="k257">["allocate review effort by consequence and uncertainty", "recognize when two reviewers share the same error source", "distinguish the disposition of a review finding, coverage of acceptance obligations and release authority"]</data>
      <data key="k260">Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.</data>
      <data key="k285">NDSE2_PUBLISHED_EDITION_20261018</data>
      <data key="k390">Author-supplied final EN/ITA 13.7.1 LaTeX sources; publication confirmed by the author on 2026-10-18.</data>
      <data key="k398">PUBLISHED_AUTHOR_CONFIRMED</data>
      <data key="k463">EN/chapters/chapter08.tex</data>
      <data key="k464">ITA/chapters/chapter08.tex</data>
      <data key="k477">b542b5aa04f66dd3fb402a4780f9ed7dacf076a6f2827d7b083887467b50e92a</data>
      <data key="k478">698ba9efd6ff328bcf2e7bfeb9f9136b14e933dad466c0b23d1fcbc789928824</data>
      <data key="k481">13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k493">Allocates review effort by consequence and uncertainty. It examines human and AI reviewers, false positives, shared blind spots and automation bias, then separates finding disposition, coverage of acceptance obligations and the accountable release verdict.</data>
      <data key="k494">Distribuisce il lavoro di revisione in base a conseguenze e incertezza. Esamina reviewer umani e AI, falsi positivi, punti ciechi condivisi e automation bias, distinguendo la gestione delle osservazioni, la copertura degli obblighi di accettazione e il verdetto di rilascio.</data>
      <data key="k498">Code Review and Trust Calibration</data>
      <data key="k500">Code review e calibrazione della fiducia</data>
      <data key="k513">V06</data>
    </node>
