    <node id="NDSE2:C09">
      <data key="k121">{"actual":["C:C09"],"authors":"Enrico Papalini","category":null,"collection":"N","id":"NDSE2:C09","kind":"published_book_chapter","label":"System Understanding, Context and Persistent Memory","limitation":"Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.","mapped":["C:C09"],"printed":false,"streams":[],"summary":"Treats context and persistent memory as claims with provenance, ownership and expiry. It develops software-specific knowledge records and invalidation rules, then uses a handoff and an explicitly limited retrieval comparison to test what a successor can reconstruct.","topics":[],"url":"","volumes":["V06"],"year":"2026"}</data>
      <data key="k126">Enrico Papalini</data>
      <data key="k153">C:C09</data>
      <data key="k155">9</data>
      <data key="k192">EDITION:NDSE2:13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k207">Published author chapter; engineering synthesis</data>
      <data key="k246">published_book_chapter</data>
      <data key="k248">System Understanding, Context and Persistent Memory</data>
      <data key="k256">["distinguere il context recuperato dalle conoscenze affidabili sul sistema", "progettare una memoria versionata con regole esplicite di invalidation", "verificare un handoff chiedendo a un nuovo maintainer di ricostruire una decisione operativa a partire dalle evidenze conservate"]</data>
      <data key="k257">["distinguish retrieved context from trusted system knowledge", "design versioned memory with explicit invalidation rules", "test a handoff by asking a new maintainer to reconstruct an operational decision from stored evidence"]</data>
      <data key="k260">Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.</data>
      <data key="k285">NDSE2_PUBLISHED_EDITION_20261018</data>
      <data key="k390">Author-supplied final EN/ITA 13.7.1 LaTeX sources; publication confirmed by the author on 2026-10-18.</data>
      <data key="k398">PUBLISHED_AUTHOR_CONFIRMED</data>
      <data key="k463">EN/chapters/chapter09.tex</data>
      <data key="k464">ITA/chapters/chapter09.tex</data>
      <data key="k477">ab431c886c607f8a192a36336c3409fa0bf9b828d20ab6d16ffd74c162641029</data>
      <data key="k478">87fbeee59f022f508080e38b413de15ce2b11b53515d7605560ddc60cb5244ea</data>
      <data key="k481">13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k493">Treats context and persistent memory as claims with provenance, ownership and expiry. It develops software-specific knowledge records and invalidation rules, then uses a handoff and an explicitly limited retrieval comparison to test what a successor can reconstruct.</data>
      <data key="k494">Tratta context e memoria persistente come affermazioni con provenienza, responsabilità e validità. Sviluppa registrazioni della conoscenza software e regole di invalidazione, usando un passaggio di consegne e un confronto di recupero esplicitamente limitato per verificare ciò che un successore può ricostruire.</data>
      <data key="k498">System Understanding, Context and Persistent Memory</data>
      <data key="k500">Comprensione del sistema, context e memoria persistente</data>
      <data key="k513">V06</data>
    </node>
