    <node id="NDSE2:C11">
      <data key="k121">{"actual":["C:C11"],"authors":"Enrico Papalini","category":null,"collection":"N","id":"NDSE2:C11","kind":"published_book_chapter","label":"Teams, Governance and the Engineering Organization","limitation":"Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.","mapped":["C:C11"],"printed":false,"streams":[],"summary":"Moves from individual output to team throughput and decision rights. Policy owners, makers, checkers and release authorities coordinate parallel work and late intention changes, with operational feedback and review capacity governing staged, reversible adoption.","topics":[],"url":"","volumes":["V06"],"year":"2026"}</data>
      <data key="k126">Enrico Papalini</data>
      <data key="k153">C:C11</data>
      <data key="k155">11</data>
      <data key="k192">EDITION:NDSE2:13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k207">Published author chapter; engineering synthesis</data>
      <data key="k246">published_book_chapter</data>
      <data key="k248">Teams, Governance and the Engineering Organization</data>
      <data key="k256">["assegnare responsabilità su policy, maker, checker e release", "coordinare in sicurezza agent paralleli e revisioni tardive della policy", "scegliere un gate di adozione reversibile a livello di team in base al carico di review e agli esiti operativi"]</data>
      <data key="k257">["assign policy, maker, checker and release responsibilities", "coordinate parallel agents and late policy revisions safely", "choose a reversible team-level adoption gate based on review load and operational outcomes"]</data>
      <data key="k260">Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.</data>
      <data key="k285">NDSE2_PUBLISHED_EDITION_20261018</data>
      <data key="k390">Author-supplied final EN/ITA 13.7.1 LaTeX sources; publication confirmed by the author on 2026-10-18.</data>
      <data key="k398">PUBLISHED_AUTHOR_CONFIRMED</data>
      <data key="k463">EN/chapters/chapter11.tex</data>
      <data key="k464">ITA/chapters/chapter11.tex</data>
      <data key="k477">18eb375b24343b3106d1530b9ca03a4a3dd0b88a58a34459858cd1f93cace300</data>
      <data key="k478">d6d2c7ee5c616cbd5012cd7d666e360aaab4413958e73e0e92ef71db50b9edb1</data>
      <data key="k481">13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k493">Moves from individual output to team throughput and decision rights. Policy owners, makers, checkers and release authorities coordinate parallel work and late intention changes, with operational feedback and review capacity governing staged, reversible adoption.</data>
      <data key="k494">Passa dall'output individuale alla capacità di consegna del team e ai diritti decisionali. Responsabili delle policy, maker, checker e autorità di rilascio coordinano lavoro parallelo e cambiamenti tardivi delle intenzioni, governando un'adozione graduale e reversibile con feedback operativo e capacità di revisione.</data>
      <data key="k498">Teams, Governance and the Engineering Organization</data>
      <data key="k500">Team, governance e organizzazione dell'ingegneria del software</data>
      <data key="k513">V06</data>
    </node>
