    <node id="NDSE2:C13">
      <data key="k121">{"actual":["C:C13"],"authors":"Enrico Papalini","category":null,"collection":"N","id":"NDSE2:C13","kind":"published_book_chapter","label":"Choosing Practices and Recognizing Their Limits","limitation":"Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.","mapped":["C:C13"],"printed":false,"streams":[],"summary":"Selects and combines practices from the observed problem rather than a fixed workflow. It compares proportionate responses, exposes over-engineering and unsafe shortcuts, and connects earlier volumes while asking which mechanisms can be omitted without losing the change obligations.","topics":[],"url":"","volumes":["V06"],"year":"2026"}</data>
      <data key="k126">Enrico Papalini</data>
      <data key="k153">C:C13</data>
      <data key="k155">13</data>
      <data key="k192">EDITION:NDSE2:13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k207">Published author chapter; engineering synthesis</data>
      <data key="k246">published_book_chapter</data>
      <data key="k248">Choosing Practices and Recognizing Their Limits</data>
      <data key="k256">["scegliere una pratica a partire da un problema osservato", "combinare pratiche senza creare conflitti di autorità o usare evidenze obsolete", "giustificare l'omissione di un meccanismo, preservando gli obblighi del task"]</data>
      <data key="k257">["select a practice from an observed problem", "combine practices without conflicting authority or stale evidence", "justify omitting a mechanism while preserving the task's obligations"]</data>
      <data key="k260">Author engineering synthesis and teaching material; publication is not independent empirical validation.</data>
      <data key="k285">NDSE2_PUBLISHED_EDITION_20261018</data>
      <data key="k390">Author-supplied final EN/ITA 13.7.1 LaTeX sources; publication confirmed by the author on 2026-10-18.</data>
      <data key="k398">PUBLISHED_AUTHOR_CONFIRMED</data>
      <data key="k463">EN/chapters/chapter13.tex</data>
      <data key="k464">ITA/chapters/chapter13.tex</data>
      <data key="k477">3fc3434f5ac2348bb0e7a15d100650848db78e857201849955543d4b08405bfa</data>
      <data key="k478">fc97b394346165efc6abeeaf66622b340180b38446227e61b7ae9e8bf3c58d0b</data>
      <data key="k481">13.7.1</data>
      <data key="k493">Selects and combines practices from the observed problem rather than a fixed workflow. It compares proportionate responses, exposes over-engineering and unsafe shortcuts, and connects earlier volumes while asking which mechanisms can be omitted without losing the change obligations.</data>
      <data key="k494">Seleziona e combina le pratiche a partire dal problema osservato. Confronta risposte proporzionate, rende visibili sovraingegnerizzazione e scorciatoie rischiose e collega i volumi precedenti, chiedendo quali meccanismi si possano omettere preservando gli obblighi del cambiamento.</data>
      <data key="k498">Choosing Practices and Recognizing Their Limits</data>
      <data key="k500">Scegliere le pratiche e riconoscerne i limiti</data>
      <data key="k513">V06</data>
    </node>
