      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node P061 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">At publication Orosz disclosed investment in DX and Tacho was DX CTO; article states it was not sponsored. The source discloses Laura Tacho’s DX role and Orosz’s investment in DX. Company measurement practices are not a new randomized causal estimate. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
