      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: I pattern di assurance collegano sicurezza, revisione graduata e comprensione del legacy. Confronto (security): Confrontare superficie di attacco dell’agente, permessi e contenimento; esposizione, dimostrazione di attacco e frequenza degli incidenti non sono misure intercambiabili. Scheda W060: Workspace and retrieved-content injections can induce agents to execute unwanted commands.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">Pattern 9: Security-First Development (L14); AI-Specific Security Incident Categories (L315)</data>
      <data key="k615">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter07/chapter07_part2.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">14</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node W060 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Attack configurations are adversarial, not real-world incidence rates.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
