      <data key="k628">Self-selected respondents and subjective reports; shared 2026 survey dataset with AI Tooling 2026 and key trends Part 1. The author reports 906 responses for the shared 2026 cohort. This is not an independently counted sample; comparisons with other survey waves are not a matched longitudinal panel. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
