    <edge id="x06616" source="B020" target="P085">
      <data key="k523">x06616</data>
      <data key="k524">comparison</data>
      <data key="k525">"ND-4cce1ff3bf9ff242"</data>
      <data key="k537">NO</data>
      <data key="k546">adoption</data>
      <data key="k560">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
      <data key="k582">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
      <data key="k596">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: I livelli di maturità aiutano a distinguere esplorazione, prova e adozione. Confronto (adoption): Confrontare selezione degli strumenti, abilitazione del team e verifica degli esiti; una graduatoria o un piano di rollout non sostituisce un pilot controllato. Scheda P085: Interviews compare tool-selection practices across company sizes, including locally scored AI review trials and procurement constraints.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">Understanding Tool Maturity Levels (L3)</data>
      <data key="k615">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/01_maturity_levels.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">3</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node P085 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Company-local scoring exercises and tool selection are distinct from randomized productivity comparisons; evaluation samples and scoring scales are context-specific. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="x06617" source="B020" target="W023">
      <data key="k523">x06617</data>
      <data key="k524">comparison</data>
      <data key="k525">"ND-972578d6677766be"</data>
      <data key="k537">NO</data>
      <data key="k546">metrics</data>
      <data key="k560">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
      <data key="k582">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
      <data key="k596">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: I livelli di maturità aiutano a distinguere esplorazione, prova e adozione. Confronto (metrics): Usare disegno dello studio, baseline e segmentazione per leggere gli indicatori; risultati di un contesto non possono essere trasferiti automaticamente a tutti i team. Scheda W023: Experienced maintainers were approximately 19% slower on familiar real-repository tasks using early-2025 tools.</data>
