      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">Chapter ch:tools-n-pratices , Section sec:static-context : Create Your First Instruction File (L1189); Chapter ch:tools-n-pratices , Section sec:dynamic-context : Add MCP to Your Workflow (L1314); Chapter ch:tools-n-pratices , Section sec:context-flow : Multi-Step Feature Implementation (L1640)</data>
