      <data key="k582">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
      <data key="k596">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: L’adozione europea combina responsabilità, provenienza e scelte di sovranità operativa. Confronto (law): Usare il confronto soltanto per governance, provenienza e scelta infrastrutturale; nessuna di queste associazioni convalida affermazioni giuridiche del volume. Scheda W053: Exposed execution grants, versionless MCP servers, and overbroad skill approvals make harness configuration an attack surface.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">The Regulatory Landscape: Three Critical Frameworks (L53); The EU Copyright Directive's TDM Exceptions (L150); Adaptation Strategies for EU Companies (L245)</data>
      <data key="k615">AI_SW_ENG/appendices/appendix_eu.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">53</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node W053 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Static configuration exposure does not prove exploitation.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
