      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node P098 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Displayed byline: Gergely Orosz. Excerpt authors: Martin Kleppmann and Chris Riccomini. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="x06960" source="B035" target="W060">
      <data key="k523">x06960</data>
      <data key="k524">comparison</data>
      <data key="k525">"ND-c67e7801e70a2e60"</data>
      <data key="k537">NO</data>
      <data key="k546">security</data>
      <data key="k560">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
      <data key="k582">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
      <data key="k596">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: L’adozione europea combina responsabilità, provenienza e scelte di sovranità operativa. Confronto (security): Confrontare superficie di attacco dell’agente, permessi e contenimento; esposizione, dimostrazione di attacco e frequenza degli incidenti non sono misure intercambiabili. Scheda W060: Workspace and retrieved-content injections can induce agents to execute unwanted commands.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">Operational Risks: Security and Data Sovereignty (L181)</data>
      <data key="k615">AI_SW_ENG/appendices/appendix_eu.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">181</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node W060 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Attack configurations are adversarial, not real-world incidence rates.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="x06961" source="B035" target="W095">
      <data key="k523">x06961</data>
