      <data key="k617">43</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node O012 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">A practitioner engineering pattern; the article does not establish comparative loop reliability by controlled experiment.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
