      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node P086 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Yegge’s eight stages are a provocative practitioner ladder, not a validated maturity scale and not Osmani’s independent agency/orchestration axes. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
