      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: Il modello a nove stadi rende discutibili competenze e prerequisiti della delega agli agenti. Confronto (autonomy): Confrontare delega, arresto ed escalation. Le scale practitioner descrivono regimi di lavoro, non una misura validata e universale della maturità. Scheda P086: A written interview explores Yegge’s autonomy ladder, multi-agent work, fatigue and predictions about engineering employment.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">Team Readiness Indicators (L217); What You Need Before Attempting Autonomous Loops (L341)</data>
      <data key="k615">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter03_evolution.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">217</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node P086 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Yegge’s eight stages are a provocative practitioner ladder, not a validated maturity scale and not Osmani’s independent agency/orchestration axes. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="x08310" source="B087" target="W118">
