      <data key="k596">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: Il modello a nove stadi rende discutibili competenze e prerequisiti della delega agli agenti. Confronto (learning): Confrontare apprendimento, autonomia cognitiva e debito di competenza; il quiz immediato del corpus non valida retention ritardata o prestazione professionale di lungo periodo. Scheda W118: Access to AI can reduce independent conceptual learning even without faster task completion.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">Stages 1--2: Learning Basic AI Tools (L80); The Skills Transformation (L264)</data>
      <data key="k615">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter03_evolution.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">80</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node W118 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Controlled learning quiz; not long-run professional performance. Immediate quiz only, not delayed retention. Source percentage normalization is unresolved; Figure 10.2 is qualitative. See Appendix B and ISSUE:V6:W118_NORMALIZATION.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
