      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node P090 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Original publication March 10; updated March 11. Reported adoption percentages use different denominators. Author discloses former employment at Uber. The source’s correction distinguishes 84% agentic-tool adoption from 65–72% IDE code-generation figures and CLI-specific measures; those denominators must not be interchanged. An author correction in the March 12, 2026 Pulse distinguishes the IDE-generated-code share from an earlier erroneous percentage. Original date, updated text and company-level denominators remain separate. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
