      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: Quality gate e backpressure trasformano gli errori in rifiuti operativi anziché in accettazioni apparenti. Confronto (oracle): Distinguere test derivati dall’intenzione da test che ripetono l’implementazione; un esito verde richiede un oracolo pertinente e sufficientemente indipendente. Scheda W077: Tests generated directly from defective implementations can encode the bug; an independent specification reduces error propagation.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">Running Tests After Every Implementation (L24); Test-Driven Autonomous Development (L124); Writing Tests Before the Loop Starts (L130)</data>
      <data key="k615">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter07_quality.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">24</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node W077 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">Specific Java defect benchmark and prompt setup.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
