      <data key="k596">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: Ralph viene adattato a Copilot tramite estensioni, CLI, subagenti o iterazione manuale. Confronto (loop): Confrontare il loop come unità di lavoro, con stato, controlli e policy esterni. I tre corpus non costituiscono repliche indipendenti dello stesso risultato. Scheda P110: Orosz traces Ralph-style loops, scheduled triggers and goal-oriented harness features.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">Ralph Loop (hehamalainen) (L107); Ralph-Wiggums-Copilot-Agent (MWChapelCLA) (L53); Ralph for GitHub Copilot (aymenfurter) (L175)</data>
      <data key="k615">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/appendices/appendix_d_copilot.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">107</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node P110 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">P110 directly links https://addyosmani.com/blog/loop-engineering/ (7 June 2026). O012 catalogues the substantially matching Substack edition (8 June 2026). Treat the edge as discussion of the same underlying work via an alternate edition, not an exact-URL citation. The paid remainder and comparative loop outcomes remain unreviewed. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
