      <data key="k597">La promessa di sviluppo continuativo viene riesaminata come problema di evidenza, autorità e non-determinismo. Ancoraggi sorgente: Introduction: The Epistemological Transition in Software Development (L12); From /loop to /goal : Native Loop Primitives (L566); Empirical Landscape: What Practitioners Actually Report (L1071); The Joint System: Context, Harness, Evidence, and Policy (L1483). Destinazione: From Reactive to Proactive AI (L25); The Continuous Loop Concept (L117); Prerequisites for Success (L246); What This Book Will Teach You (L319)</data>
