      <data key="k597">Proposizione del file: Si sceglie il meccanismo minimo che affronta un fallimento osservato e dispone di un segnale esterno verificabile. Confronto (cost): Confrontare il costo dell’intero esito accettato, inclusi verifica e rilavorazione; ROI di scenario e testimonianze di consumo non sono rendimenti sperimentali. Scheda O008: A software factory is many governed loops; its level of human involvement changes both risk and total operating cost.</data>
      <data key="k603">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
      <data key="k614">The Capstone Orchestra: When Composition Earns Its Cost (L954); 3. What is the cost of accepting a wrong result? (L1229); 6. Does the next stage earn its cost? (L1241)</data>
      <data key="k615">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter06_choosing_the_right_loop.tex</data>
      <data key="k617">954</data>
      <data key="k627">Frozen v6 node O008 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
      <data key="k628">A conceptual taxonomy and projections, not a controlled comparison of factory operating models.</data>
      <data key="k631">NO</data>
    </edge>
